--- !u!114 &1092041883
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1092041878}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3e089ff522d943a43841218e73d83b3a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  interactRadius: 7.5
  interactKey: 101
  player: {fileID: 0}
  conversation:
  - npcLine: "Hey there! Welcome to the demo. Don't panic \u2014 I know I\u2019m
      a dolphin standing upright. Just go with it"
    emotion: 0
    options:
    - playerLine: "Uh\u2026 hi? What is this place?"
      nextNodeIndex: 1
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: Skip the small talk, just tell me what to do.
      nextNodeIndex: 2
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: Are you always like this?
      nextNodeIndex: 3
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
  - npcLine: "This is the Level Sandbox! You can run around, test weapons, bully
      a few enemies\u2026 the usual. And don\u2019t worry, you\u2019re completely
      invincible here. Demo magic."
    emotion: 1
    options:
    - playerLine: Okay, how do I actually move and fight?
      nextNodeIndex: 4
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: Invincible? Nice. How do I get ammo?
      nextNodeIndex: 5
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: "What's this \u2018Aura\u2019 thing?"
      nextNodeIndex: 6
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
  - npcLine: Alright, straight to business. You wanna know how to control stuff?
      I can work with that.
    emotion: 0
    options:
    - playerLine: Yeah, give me the controls.
      nextNodeIndex: 4
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: Ammo. Show me the ammo.
      nextNodeIndex: 5
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: Aura. I like shiny things.
      nextNodeIndex: 6
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
  - npcLine: Always like what? Gorgeous? Helpful? Mildly unhinged? Take your pick.
    emotion: 1
    options:
    - playerLine: "You\u2019re actually kinda charismatic."
      nextNodeIndex: 1
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: Okay okay, tell me how to play.
      nextNodeIndex: 4
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: Tell me about rewards.
      nextNodeIndex: 7
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
  - npcLine: "Shift = sprint, F while sprinting = jump.\nScroll or 1\u20135 swaps
      weapons.\nHold Space for slow-mo.\nWhile in Air: Right-Click + spin = trickshots,
      add Q/E to roll.\nLeft click - shoot/melee, R - reload."
    emotion: 0
    options:
    - playerLine: "That\u2019s actually sick."
      nextNodeIndex: 8
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: Okay, now tell me about ammo.
      nextNodeIndex: 5
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: Cool, and Aura?
      nextNodeIndex: 6
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
  - npcLine: "Ammo drops come from enemies \u2014 they have a chance to spit out
      ammo when you take them out. Keep an eye out for the little packs.\nAnd remember,
      some NPCs, like me, can just hand you ammo if you pick the right dialogue option."
    emotion: 0
    options:
    - playerLine: "And Aura? How\u2019s that work?"
      nextNodeIndex: 6
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: Got it. What else?
      nextNodeIndex: 7
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
  - npcLine: "Aura\u2019s a special currency. Good vibes made real. You\u2019ll be
      able to buy stuff with it later\u2026 or even unlock a certain someone if you
      collect enough.\nAnd just like ammo, some NPCs, like me, can give you Aura
      if you pick the right dialogue option."
    emotion: 0
    options:
    - playerLine: Nice. Tell me more things.
      nextNodeIndex: 7
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: Back to the basics, controls.
      nextNodeIndex: 4
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
  - npcLine: 'Quick recap: some NPCs give you rewards based on what you pick. Be
      nice, get Aura. Be blunt, get ammo. You choose the vibe.'
    emotion: 0
    options:
    - playerLine: Give me an example reward now.
      nextNodeIndex: 9
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: Alright, tell me the controls again.
      nextNodeIndex: 4
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: Cool. Thanks, Dolphin lady.
      nextNodeIndex: -1
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
  - npcLine: "Right? You look like you\u2019ll pull off something ridiculous. I believe
      in you."
    emotion: 1
    options:
    - playerLine: Thanks. Ammo next.
      nextNodeIndex: 5
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: "\u201CAura next."
      nextNodeIndex: 6
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: Bye for now.
      nextNodeIndex: -1
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 0
  - npcLine: Easy. Ask nicely,  I give you Aura. Ask rudely, I give you ammo. Try
      both whenever you want; I'm not judging.
    emotion: 1
    options:
    - playerLine: "Uh\u2026 please may I have Aura?"
      nextNodeIndex: -1
      givesAura: 1
      givesAmmo: 0
    - playerLine: Gimme ammo, fish-lady.
      nextNodeIndex: -1
      givesAura: 0
      givesAmmo: 1
    - playerLine: How about both?
      nextNodeIndex: -1
      givesAura: 1
      givesAmmo: 1
